WEBVTT

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:18.515
Aren't you hot wearing that?
Why must you go home now?

00:00:18.619 --> 00:00:20.485
You already failed the
college entrance exam twice!

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:23.216
| don’t think it’s a good time
for you to take a vacation!

00:00:23.557 --> 00:00:27.494
I'll come back after | attend the class
reunion party tomorrow, Rumiko.

00:00:36.003 --> 00:00:37.198
You’re
so
e
asygoin
g!

00:01:04.932 --> 00:01:08.562
My necklace is rattling...
The Hakusan shrine?

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.130
Shiratori...?

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:17.170
This is where Yamato-takeru-nomikoto
supposedly came down from the sky.

00:01:17.711 --> 00:01:19.702
W...What’s this?

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:34.955
Chris! What is going on?
Chris...!

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:50.473
Show me the ancient Japanese man’s...

00:01:50.544 --> 00:01:51.807
Spirit!

00:01:52.646 --> 00:01:55.377
Use the power of the earth and water...

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:57.313
and power of Amitaba!

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:03.121
Who are you! A ghost?

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:05.481
Do you think a ghost
speaks like this?

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:08.155
Then who are you?
Yamato-takeru-nomikoto?

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:12.159
-A man is falling down!
-A young man...isn’t he?

00:02:17.371 --> 00:02:18.395
What’s this?!

00:02:21.441 --> 00:02:22.533
That's a Daragau!

00:02:22.643 --> 00:02:24.441
W What?!
hat’s going on?!

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:27.737
What’s that light?!

00:02:34.554 --> 00:02:35.919
Get down on the other side!

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:38.315
Garzey’s Wing?!

00:02:39.026 --> 00:02:39.788
Really?!

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:40.826
It’s shining!

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:47.992
You did it!

00:02:48.068 --> 00:02:49.365
W...Who are you?!

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:50.560
I’m Falan Fa!

00:02:51.405 --> 00:02:52.099
W...What?!

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:54.333
Hassan! There's the Holy Warrior!

00:02:55.242 --> 00:03:00.373
That skill...Is he the Holy Warrior?!
But, why he is accompanied by a Fellario?!

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:03.105
This little squirt just followed me!

00:03:06.219 --> 00:03:07.084
What?!

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.712
They use another language, but | can
communicate with them through my mind.

00:03:09.923 --> 00:03:11.755
Did Garzey’s Wing appear?

00:03:15.829 --> 00:03:17.297
What a beautiful woman!

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:19.927
Is he just a lecher?

00:03:20.434 --> 00:03:22.664
Oh! Is this
the Garzey’s Wing?!

00:03:23.537 --> 00:03:25.528
This will help us
successfully escape.

00:03:25.739 --> 00:03:27.503
Hassan, thank you
for bringing him here.

00:03:28.075 --> 00:03:30.066
Thanks to the power of
this earthen-ware bell.

00:03:32.446 --> 00:03:35.609
Keep walking! Use the escape
route we originally planned!

00:03:36.216 --> 00:03:37.377
-There they come!
-Get them!

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:38.541
-Take it.
-A bow and arrow?!

00:03:38.652 --> 00:03:39.915
-It’s ok to kill them!
-Don’t kill them all!

00:03:39.986 --> 00:03:40.953
What happened to the war-beasts?

00:03:41.021 --> 00:03:42.511
Run!

00:03:44.124 --> 00:03:45.057
You bastard!

00:03:48.595 --> 00:03:49.460
Give this to the Holy Warrior!

00:03:49.596 --> 00:03:51.963
The winged Fellario thinks
she can help him?!

00:03:52.099 --> 00:03:52.861
Where am I?

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.395
Here are your shoes.

00:03:54.935 --> 00:03:55.766
Thank you!

00:03:56.136 --> 00:03:58.764
Women and the elderly,
go straight down this way!

00:04:04.144 --> 00:04:06.511
Oh, my god!
ls this a real war?

00:04:07.948 --> 00:04:09.438
We are the Metomeus tribe.

00:04:09.549 --> 00:04:12.109
We’re escaping from slavery
under the Ashigaba tribe.

00:04:12.986 --> 00:04:16.945
Now that Garzey’s Wing is here,
we can successfully escape.

00:04:20.761 --> 00:04:23.196
Maiden Hassan’s prediction
has come true!

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.688
What is this?

00:04:26.299 --> 00:04:27.562
Where did they go?

00:04:37.144 --> 00:04:38.509
These flying arrows
are a little slow!

00:04:38.645 --> 00:04:39.737
Down those stairs!

00:04:39.946 --> 00:04:41.072
There’s the Daragau!

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:46.981
Use the dead man’s sword
Mr. Holy Warrior, Garzey’s Wing!

00:04:53.193 --> 00:04:54.661
Let go! You!

00:04:56.663 --> 00:04:58.654
This is heavier than a Japanese sword!

00:04:59.733 --> 00:05:00.962
But | can stop these arrows!

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:02.634
What’s that?!

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:05.904
Don’t be afraid of such a small fire!

00:05:06.106 --> 00:05:07.767
-Over here!
-Come over here!

00:05:09.342 --> 00:05:10.571
What are you doing?!

00:05:10.911 --> 00:05:14.643
Since tribes are escaping all over,
we can just sneak into the forest.

00:05:14.948 --> 00:05:16.575
How many people are escaping?

00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:18.810
There are about 1,000 or so
just in the Metomeus tribe.

00:05:23.123 --> 00:05:25.490
This warrior, Garzey’s Wing,
interfered and now...

00:05:25.659 --> 00:05:29.459
more than 5,000 slaves that were
building this palace have escaped!

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:32.897
The soldiers and the war-beasts
were terrified by Garzey’s Wing.

00:05:33.099 --> 00:05:35.864
We only had a small
compliment of troops there.

00:05:36.169 --> 00:05:39.764
This so-called “Holy Warrior Legend”
comes to my palace in Izumido...

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:42.338
and he dares to oppose me!

00:05:42.809 --> 00:05:46.768
Chase him out! Garzey’s Wing
is just a legendary illusion!

00:05:47.214 --> 00:05:51.082
My Lord, the revolt was just
1,000 of the Metomeus tribe.

00:05:51.618 --> 00:05:55.646
And Holy Warrior Garzey’s Wing
is just one soldier!

00:05:56.156 --> 00:05:57.954
Send out the War-Beast Corps!

00:06:01.595 --> 00:06:02.619
| found them!

00:06:13.573 --> 00:06:14.836
They found us!

00:06:29.956 --> 00:06:31.287
Don’t go this way!

00:06:31.391 --> 00:06:32.950
Have the foot soldiers
take another route!

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:35.053
Hey! Don't try it!
It’s impossible!

00:06:36.096 --> 00:06:39.623
If you force the Daragau into
Touz Marsh, it will only sink in it.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.901
We’re also pursuing those who
escaped into the mountains, right?

00:06:43.036 --> 00:06:45.164
Yes, we are pursuing them as well!

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:46.567
Move out!

00:06:50.911 --> 00:06:55.405
Damn Metomeus! They're trying to
get to the river through the marsh.

00:07:06.693 --> 00:07:09.128
The Bunzudos can't fly
that far down the river.

00:07:09.963 --> 00:07:11.522
How can we attack?

00:07:13.633 --> 00:07:15.192
You can't ride that horse here!

00:07:15.635 --> 00:07:16.796
This is urgent!

00:07:17.671 --> 00:07:18.638
Sir Zagizoa!

00:07:19.406 --> 00:07:22.034
Oh! You came back Zagizoa.

00:07:22.876 --> 00:07:25.140
Please forgive my rudeness.
I've been troubled by this incident.

00:07:26.079 --> 00:07:30.380
Why have you returned from your
war with the savage western tribe?

00:07:31.217 --> 00:07:32.309
It’s a leap year.

00:07:33.053 --> 00:07:36.819
l’ve known about the rumor that
the Metomeus tribe might revolt.

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:39.322
| was concerned about them uprising.

00:07:39.659 --> 00:07:43.289
Yes, without regard for their
bondage, the Metomeus tribe...

00:07:43.663 --> 00:07:47.463
secretly chose their own king
and summoned Garzey’s Wing.

00:07:48.234 --> 00:07:50.134
Because it’s a leap year,
they think they’ve found the way...

00:07:50.236 --> 00:07:51.670
to the Great Barju Tree.

00:07:55.008 --> 00:07:59.639
You mean...you must have
deliberately let them escape!

00:08:00.246 --> 00:08:03.546
Let them find the Great Barju Tree
and then destroy them.

00:08:03.683 --> 00:08:05.674
Yes Sir!...Did the Maidens of the
Metomeus tribe also escape...?

00:08:05.819 --> 00:08:07.583
from the palace
construction site ?

00:08:08.455 --> 00:08:10.219
If they didn't...

00:08:14.728 --> 00:08:16.822
then how else did
Garzey's Wing appear!

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:17.963
indeed!

00:08:20.033 --> 00:08:24.994
| want you to gain the power
of the Great Barju Tree.

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:37.047
-Can we reach the river?
-Of course we can.

00:08:37.584 --> 00:08:39.143
Can't go any further!

00:08:39.552 --> 00:08:43.386
Bunzudo go back! If you want
some Ishubara...turn back!

00:08:44.391 --> 00:08:46.416
Fools! Before you get
down the river...

00:08:46.526 --> 00:08:48.517
you'll all be eaten alive
by the Kavika and Fundo!

00:09:01.341 --> 00:09:03.332
-ls that a Fundo!?
-| think so.

00:09:04.077 --> 00:09:05.101
Everybody who has a
bow and arrow, prepare!

00:09:05.245 --> 00:09:05.973
Ready!

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:08.812
it seems like there’s
a male and a female.

00:09:16.456 --> 00:09:18.151
Damn you!

00:09:29.369 --> 00:09:30.598
Get back!

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:34.464
Hurry up and run!

00:09:34.574 --> 00:09:36.338
Get out from here while they’re
feeding on each other!

00:09:40.113 --> 00:09:44.448
| think they said Holy Warrior
and Garzey’s Wing or something...

00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:46.749
Absurd!

00:09:47.353 --> 00:09:48.184
Go away, you rat!

00:09:48.354 --> 00:09:50.118
Oh...the winged creature!

00:09:51.024 --> 00:09:53.083
Damn you!
Get away!

00:09:56.062 --> 00:09:57.621
Hey! That’s dangerous!

00:09:57.730 --> 00:10:00.961
S...Sorry, but this sword
is not sharp at all...

00:10:01.267 --> 00:10:05.226
Come on! What are you doing?
Act like a Holy Warrior!

00:10:05.672 --> 00:10:07.106
| have nothing to do with that!

00:10:07.307 --> 00:10:11.175
You appeared wearing Garzey’s Wing!
Who else would you say you are!

00:10:11.678 --> 00:10:13.009
Stop telling me that!

00:10:13.113 --> 00:10:15.707
Why did you take me from
my home in Kustanga Hill...

00:10:15.815 --> 00:10:21.879
and bring me to the Komon World
to help Hassan and her people?

00:10:22.322 --> 00:10:25.952
How can | explain a strange thing
to a strange little creature like you!

00:10:26.459 --> 00:10:29.622
Strange! Little!
Do you think I’m weird?!

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:31.795
| wouldn't go that far.

00:10:32.165 --> 00:10:33.599
But that's what you were
thinking in your mind!

00:10:33.766 --> 00:10:35.757
What are you talking about?
Oh, I see...

00:10:36.536 --> 00:10:38.595
People communicate by
telepathy in this world.

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.536
I’m sorry...Hey, stop crying.

00:10:44.277 --> 00:10:46.268
I’m just a Fellario!

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:50.914
Ok, | understand. This world is
where your kind of people belong.

00:10:52.886 --> 00:10:54.877
If you didn’t fly out...

00:10:54.988 --> 00:10:57.650
| would still be
in Kustanga Hill...

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:00.691
playing with my friends
and Grandma Moai.

00:11:01.394 --> 00:11:04.329
And | could have attended
my high school class reunion.

00:11:05.064 --> 00:11:06.429
Where is the Holy Warrior?

00:11:07.233 --> 00:11:08.530
-Over there?
-Yeah!

00:11:10.503 --> 00:11:12.301
They are planning to
go down the river.

00:11:12.539 --> 00:11:13.199
What?

00:11:20.213 --> 00:11:23.080
After you pass 12 peaks, dock
the raft at the opposite shore.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.509
Here we go chief!

00:11:25.718 --> 00:11:26.913
Lord Holy Warrior!

00:11:27.287 --> 00:11:28.948
-Hassan!
-Yes

00:11:29.689 --> 00:11:32.954
You better tie that sword with
rope and carry it on your back..

00:11:33.359 --> 00:11:34.326
| appreciate it.

00:11:35.828 --> 00:11:38.559
We also want you to push
a raft, Lord Holy Warrior.

00:11:39.599 --> 00:11:40.964
| don’t mind.

00:11:47.173 --> 00:11:48.163
-Tance!
-Hang on!

00:11:48.575 --> 00:11:50.373
Hold on to the raft!

00:11:50.777 --> 00:11:52.211
Keep your hands on!

00:11:54.447 --> 00:11:56.779
How far are you planning to go?!

00:11:56.916 --> 00:11:58.714
We’re going back to our land.

00:11:58.885 --> 00:12:03.379
We need land and food!
For women to give birth to children.

00:12:04.123 --> 00:12:04.988
Maiden!

00:12:05.124 --> 00:12:08.253
If you can make me a Holy Warrior
we'll somehow manage, won’t we?

00:12:09.429 --> 00:12:11.056
It’s not that easy!

00:12:12.332 --> 00:12:15.165
Hassan, why don’t you send that
troublesome little Fellario away?!

00:12:15.602 --> 00:12:18.264
Leelince!
She is helping Tance!

00:12:18.805 --> 00:12:22.639
Those little creatures with wings,
and the adult Fellario are the ones...

00:12:22.775 --> 00:12:24.106
who bring us down!

00:12:24.677 --> 00:12:26.145
I’ve never heard of such a thing!

00:12:32.085 --> 00:12:33.575
| hear myself calling to me...

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:42.719
You just came back?

00:12:42.862 --> 00:12:43.658
Yeah.

00:12:45.798 --> 00:12:47.197
Morning practice?

00:12:50.837 --> 00:12:54.137
What happened to the necklace
you got from the family shrine?

00:12:54.741 --> 00:12:56.209
What...it’s missing?

00:12:56.943 --> 00:12:58.638
| couldn't have dropped it.

00:12:58.945 --> 00:13:01.676
-Did you give it to your girlfriend?
-You know | wouldn't!

00:13:02.315 --> 00:13:04.647
| will get a new one right away.

00:13:05.318 --> 00:13:09.880
The necklace with 8 bells...is
very important for protection.

00:13:10.256 --> 00:13:10.984
I'd appreciate it.

00:13:11.124 --> 00:13:13.855
Sorry to force her old
fashioned customs on you.

00:13:14.327 --> 00:13:16.523
Don’t worry. It’s my taste, too.

00:13:17.497 --> 00:13:18.225
What are you doing?

00:13:18.331 --> 00:13:20.129
You have new bruises.

00:13:20.533 --> 00:13:21.898
They don’t look like
they're from kendo practice.

00:13:22.068 --> 00:13:23.433
Oh?...Really?

00:13:32.478 --> 00:13:34.810
Ondel, I’m glad that your
group escaped unhurt, too.

00:13:36.516 --> 00:13:38.507
For the past two years,
| have been storing weapons...

00:13:38.651 --> 00:13:40.551
and long awaiting your return,
Lord Ketta Keras.

00:13:42.088 --> 00:13:44.420
That young man...
is he the Holy Warrior?

00:13:44.891 --> 00:13:46.381
So far as we know...

00:13:46.859 --> 00:13:47.724
What?...

00:13:47.894 --> 00:13:50.488
| have no intention to help
make a prosperous kingdom!

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:53.324
We have been preparing
medicinal herbs and foods...

00:13:53.466 --> 00:13:58.336
to take back Tan Town from
the Ashigaba tribe invaders...

00:13:58.671 --> 00:14:02.335
ever since you appeared with
Garzey’s Wing and the Fellario.

00:14:03.042 --> 00:14:06.672
It’s not what | wanted
It’s Yamato-takeru-nomikoto’s...

00:14:09.315 --> 00:14:10.646
The bells on the necklace...!

00:14:12.051 --> 00:14:12.847
What?

00:14:14.387 --> 00:14:16.549
Hassan has started to pray...

00:14:22.695 --> 00:14:24.891
Lord Chris’s bells are rattling...

00:14:25.598 --> 00:14:28.067
because he is to
become a Holy Warrior.

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:33.036
If these bells brought me here...

00:14:33.139 --> 00:14:35.665
| wish you would use them
to send me back to my world!

00:14:36.743 --> 00:14:37.869
That makes sense!

00:14:38.478 --> 00:14:40.810
My abilities are limited
to bringing you here.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:44.848
Right now, | have to prepare to
summon Garzey’s Wing at any time.

00:14:45.118 --> 00:14:47.746
Otherwise, Lord Chris,
your life will be in danger.

00:14:48.821 --> 00:14:53.452
That means if | act like f'm in
my world, | could die immediately.

00:14:56.129 --> 00:14:59.099
The Holy Warrior Garzey’s Wing...

00:14:59.799 --> 00:15:01.699
is a legend passed down from
generation to generation.

00:15:03.736 --> 00:15:05.431
to save the oppressed tribes.

00:15:06.005 --> 00:15:06.870
What?!

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:09.374
We can bring the hero here...

00:15:09.809 --> 00:15:12.141
because this is a world created
by human aura power...

00:15:12.278 --> 00:15:14.440
Because this world is Byston Well.

00:15:19.819 --> 00:15:21.913
/ can't be a macho-man like them!

00:15:28.394 --> 00:15:29.862
Where are you?

00:15:36.235 --> 00:15:39.068
Because we can communicate to
each other through these bells...

00:15:39.205 --> 00:15:41.606
They might lead to a way
to get back.

00:15:43.276 --> 00:15:45.608
Can you find the
way back from there?

00:15:45.812 --> 00:15:48.144
| felt like | was having a dream...

00:15:58.524 --> 00:16:00.549
Ouch! My body is aching.
What happened?

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:03.559
/ was bruised all over my body,
because { had to fight naked.

00:16:03.896 --> 00:16:06.331
Mom told me | have
bruises all over...

00:16:06.866 --> 00:16:08.891
Is there any connection?

00:16:09.168 --> 00:16:11.500
There’s a war going on.
Even dinosaurs are here...

00:16:11.637 --> 00:16:14.663
And they use bows and arrows.
My sword is unbelievably dull.

00:16:15.741 --> 00:16:18.676
If you die there, what
will happen to me here?!

00:16:19.345 --> 00:16:22.007
i don’t know whether our
body and mind have split...

00:16:22.114 --> 00:16:25.049
i don’t know how we got separated,
but we are still one person!

00:16:26.652 --> 00:16:28.279
We die together?

00:16:29.555 --> 00:16:31.819
-Probably...
-You’re kidding!

00:16:32.024 --> 00:16:36.552
i'm not joking! It’s like 'm dealing
with 12 or 13" century foreigners!

00:16:38.197 --> 00:16:42.191
| can barely make
sense of our situations.

00:16:43.603 --> 00:16:45.935
If you say you are
in an “aura” world...

00:16:46.072 --> 00:16:48.404
then | have to
strengthen my mind.

00:16:48.541 --> 00:16:50.566
Must do Chi, and Zen meditation.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:53.242
fam being chased
by areal army!

00:16:53.713 --> 00:16:56.148
I know!
| will do that here!

00:16:56.415 --> 00:16:57.507
Please do it!

00:16:59.886 --> 00:17:02.685
But really...how do
i deal with this?

00:17:05.391 --> 00:17:07.723
Use the Jigenryu
kendo technique.

00:17:21.874 --> 00:17:23.171
This is nota
one round match here.

00:17:23.376 --> 00:17:26.676
-Who are you talking to?
-Myself, in my own world.

00:17:27.079 --> 00:17:29.241
Is there one more you
in your world?

00:17:29.482 --> 00:17:30.449
lt seems so.

00:17:30.616 --> 00:17:32.948
Hey Chris!
You can make gunpowder...

00:17:33.085 --> 00:17:36.885
Mix equal amounts of sulfuric acid
potassium, sulfur and charcoal.

00:17:37.523 --> 00:17:40.891
There is no pharmacy here!
What are you reading?

00:17:41.527 --> 00:17:42.824
An encyclopedia.

00:17:43.062 --> 00:17:45.690
If this is a war with
swords and bows...

00:17:46.165 --> 00:17:48.862
You'll have to take advantage of the
wind, water, and the landscape.

00:17:49.001 --> 00:17:51.333
It’s important to use
all things in nature, wisely.

00:17:53.673 --> 00:17:55.767
Memorizing? Working hard.

00:17:56.142 --> 00:17:57.769
Uh, yeah...Where's Mom?

00:17:58.210 --> 00:17:59.268
She went to the store.

00:17:59.478 --> 00:18:00.172
| see.

00:18:00.279 --> 00:18:01.007
Ouch!

00:18:01.747 --> 00:18:04.910
Grandma, why did you make
hot noodles on a hot day?!

00:18:05.017 --> 00:18:06.610
It’s easier to digest.

00:18:06.752 --> 00:18:07.810
It’s too hot...!

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:10.785
You're wearing the necklace
| got for you this morning.

00:18:14.293 --> 00:18:17.285
I’m going to the class
reunion at the pool.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:20.299
| think it'll be good
for my mental condition.

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:21.892
Of course...

00:18:22.468 --> 00:18:24.800
Shutting yourself in the house
is not the only way to study.

00:18:35.982 --> 00:18:38.314
For the honor of
the Cavalrymen!

00:18:38.451 --> 00:18:40.476
Chase out the Metomeus tribe!

00:18:43.789 --> 00:18:48.420
Are you sure about the scout's
report, Lord Gelgog Aji?

00:18:48.894 --> 00:18:52.353
They are heading north along the
lower slopes of Anazo Kuzei Mountain.

00:18:53.065 --> 00:18:56.626
Horses! Horses are coming!
Bunzudo are coming, too!

00:18:56.802 --> 00:18:58.736
It’s just the cavalry...

00:18:58.804 --> 00:18:59.965
Don’t be afraid!

00:19:00.539 --> 00:19:02.439
That’s right! Women and children
should go along the river!

00:19:02.575 --> 00:19:04.907
Sorry, but the injured have to
act as a decoy...

00:19:04.977 --> 00:19:06.274
It will buy us some time.

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:09.712
Are we using those
people as decoys?

00:19:10.383 --> 00:19:12.784
Hassan, Aishe and Tance
should get into the wagon!

00:19:12.918 --> 00:19:15.250
Yes...
Sechuku, good luck!

00:19:16.288 --> 00:19:19.815
Never die!
You’re the treasure of our tribe!

00:19:20.259 --> 00:19:21.920
-Don’t get killed!
-You too!

00:19:25.031 --> 00:19:27.363
Why does our supreme
commander leave first?

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:32.460
The wagon is taking a dangerous route.
It's also a decoy.

00:19:32.972 --> 00:19:35.703
This is Gada.
It will explode if you drop it.

00:19:35.875 --> 00:19:41.177
While Ketta Keras escapes,
I'll hold off the enemy.

00:19:42.081 --> 00:19:43.981
-You follow me!
-Sure.

00:19:48.087 --> 00:19:48.918
Leelince!

00:19:49.588 --> 00:19:51.215
What are Domon and
other people doing?

00:19:51.357 --> 00:19:52.791
They're the suicide squad.

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.695
That was close.

00:20:03.903 --> 00:20:05.428
| don’t need a Fellario’s help!

00:20:05.738 --> 00:20:06.864
How insulting!

00:20:06.939 --> 00:20:10.341
You’re the Holy Warrior!
Why don’t you fight like one?

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:13.638
| never said that
I'm the Holy Warrior!

00:20:13.746 --> 00:20:16.238
Then, why don’t we
live together somewhere else?

00:20:17.283 --> 00:20:19.911
If you had a convenience store,
I‘d live with you.

00:20:20.219 --> 00:20:21.243
What’s that?

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:24.117
But here, there are no
vending machines either.

00:20:24.256 --> 00:20:25.553
What are you talking about?

00:20:29.495 --> 00:20:30.690
Please go off at the right time.

00:20:32.465 --> 00:20:34.024
Watch out for the fuses!

00:20:48.347 --> 00:20:51.942
Maiden Hassan must have
summoned Garzey’s Wing!

00:20:55.888 --> 00:20:58.880
| told you | would treat you well,
yet you escaped.

00:20:59.291 --> 00:21:00.452
Follow me, everyone!

00:21:03.629 --> 00:21:05.961
Did you set Gada at
the entrance area, too?

00:21:06.132 --> 00:21:07.031
Yes!

00:21:07.133 --> 00:21:12.537
Good work! When you get inside, follow
this stream. It'll lead you outside.

00:21:12.905 --> 00:21:13.701
-Then you can mark the path.
-Yes!

00:21:13.806 --> 00:21:14.398
Yes!

00:21:16.809 --> 00:21:18.743
Stop it! It will blow up!

00:21:18.844 --> 00:21:20.278
Don’t bother me.

00:21:21.447 --> 00:21:23.779
Are you covering that
in Gada powder?

00:21:23.983 --> 00:21:25.417
| am trying to...

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:29.116
It doesn’t work...

00:21:29.221 --> 00:21:32.156
Look! My wings’
roots are oily.

00:21:32.925 --> 00:21:33.448
Yeah.

00:21:33.559 --> 00:21:35.891
It sticks when you
put it on your hands.

00:21:36.061 --> 00:21:36.994
| see.

00:21:40.666 --> 00:21:42.998
The archery squad should
move inside more!

00:21:43.135 --> 00:21:45.627
Chris! What are you doing?
The Gada will blow you up!

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.106
Hey, you! Come inside!

00:21:50.209 --> 00:21:51.438
Let me try this!

00:21:53.012 --> 00:21:54.343
They set Gada
around the entrance!

00:21:54.446 --> 00:21:55.607
Don’t let them find our trap.

00:21:55.748 --> 00:21:58.080
/ grew up playing with
my Grandpa’s arrows.

00:21:58.684 --> 00:22:00.174
I’m sure | can use
this arrow easily.

00:22:03.756 --> 00:22:04.723
Hit it!

00:22:09.361 --> 00:22:11.022
That’s a clever way to use it!

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:13.697
Chifuchi, get the archers
to do the same thing!

00:22:16.068 --> 00:22:19.470
You weren't joking about this
having strong explosive power!

00:22:19.605 --> 00:22:20.834
But you did it!

00:22:21.507 --> 00:22:23.407
Use resin for glue, Chifuchi!

00:22:23.542 --> 00:22:24.338
Got it!

00:22:24.476 --> 00:22:25.910
Leelince! You find the route!

00:22:26.111 --> 00:22:27.306
Take over for me, Hendock!

00:22:27.613 --> 00:22:28.444
Good luck, Lord Chris!

00:22:28.514 --> 00:22:29.276
Yes.

00:22:29.815 --> 00:22:31.909
Set up the second and third scaffolding!

00:22:33.219 --> 00:22:34.983
You can’t use Gada here!

00:22:35.087 --> 00:22:36.555
We're using close combat?

00:22:36.655 --> 00:22:39.147
Stand on each strategic point
and guide the reinforcements!

00:22:39.225 --> 00:22:39.783
Ok!

00:22:39.959 --> 00:22:41.358
Can we go down?

00:22:41.427 --> 00:22:42.826
If you can fly,
check it out for yourself!

00:22:42.928 --> 00:22:44.225
Don’t get mad!

00:22:44.330 --> 00:22:45.889
Here they come!
Damn, they’re using torches!

00:22:46.599 --> 00:22:48.931
-Aim for the Gada!
-Fire!

00:22:54.240 --> 00:22:57.073
We use the Gada on the entrance!
You got it?!

00:22:57.409 --> 00:22:59.400
That's a wise way to use it.

00:22:59.545 --> 00:23:03.004
This bowstring is worn out.
It may snap.

00:23:05.351 --> 00:23:06.648
What is that light?

00:23:06.785 --> 00:23:08.446
Wait until you see the cavalry!

00:23:08.687 --> 00:23:10.246
We'll walk from here!

00:23:10.389 --> 00:23:11.254
-Yes!
-Do it!

00:23:12.758 --> 00:23:13.554
It snapped!

00:23:17.429 --> 00:23:21.889
They used up all of their Gada!
Get them! Now is our chance!

00:23:27.473 --> 00:23:29.168
You are deluded by the light!

00:23:32.044 --> 00:23:34.103
A sound of metal armor from here?!

00:23:37.349 --> 00:23:39.340
The clatter of horse hoofs...?

00:23:40.286 --> 00:23:42.084
We are never going
to escape from here.

00:23:49.361 --> 00:23:50.988
They’re coming
from here too!

00:23:51.797 --> 00:23:53.231
| can also hear the cavalry!

00:23:55.467 --> 00:23:56.662
They caught up to us!

00:23:56.769 --> 00:23:59.670
Hide the fuses!
We'll fight on these stairs!

00:24:00.205 --> 00:24:02.799
Give arrows to the people
who have the usable bows!

00:24:04.276 --> 00:24:07.041
Make a circle around the fuses!

00:24:08.080 --> 00:24:08.603
Circle?

00:24:08.681 --> 00:24:09.910
-Give me your arrows.
-Sure.

00:24:10.649 --> 00:24:12.174
Holy Warrior, go to the top
on the right side.

00:24:12.284 --> 00:24:13.183
Ok!

00:24:13.352 --> 00:24:14.080
Ouch!

00:24:20.859 --> 00:24:24.454
Grandma Moai always says, "You
can do it, if you have the confidence!”.

00:24:24.797 --> 00:24:26.492
Somebody make
this little one shut up!

00:24:26.598 --> 00:24:27.861
What? A bell ringing?

00:24:29.635 --> 00:24:31.194
Just keep running!

00:24:36.976 --> 00:24:39.536
| set up the gada!
Start the fire!

00:24:40.045 --> 00:24:44.175
Ketta Keras and Hassan are
trying to get the enemy’s attention.

00:24:48.387 --> 00:24:50.048
They’re using kerosene!

00:25:02.334 --> 00:25:04.826
Sounds like arrows?
Are you in danger? Chris?!

00:25:06.705 --> 00:25:08.571
| have no choice
but to see my friends...

00:25:29.328 --> 00:25:31.456
Don’t be afraid!
It’s just a motley bunch!

00:25:38.737 --> 00:25:41.069
They've set a Gada trap!
Find the fire!

00:25:45.978 --> 00:25:47.104
Please work!

00:25:51.717 --> 00:25:52.707
What's happening?!

00:25:57.089 --> 00:25:57.954
Lord Chris!

00:26:02.661 --> 00:26:05.062
This has gone too far,
Metomeus tribe!

00:26:14.039 --> 00:26:15.268
Damn you!

00:26:23.782 --> 00:26:26.444
The ceiling is collapsing.
Chris, use this!

00:26:40.499 --> 00:26:41.625
Garzey’s Wing!

00:26:45.804 --> 00:26:49.331
| am not from the Metomeus tribe!
| am Christopher Senshu!

00:26:55.914 --> 00:26:57.348
Garzey’s Holy Warrior?!

00:26:57.749 --> 00:26:59.046
-Wings of...
-Light!

00:27:01.520 --> 00:27:03.045
The wings are easy targets!

00:27:17.603 --> 00:27:18.661
Gelgog Aji?

00:27:27.546 --> 00:27:32.245
Hassan’s prayers summoned a real
Garzey’s Wing Holy Warrior?

00:27:34.686 --> 00:27:36.085
That woman!!

00:27:46.565 --> 00:27:48.533
It’s wings spread out!

00:27:48.700 --> 00:27:50.498
Is it true? | am glad.

00:27:51.436 --> 00:27:55.339
It is all because Lord Chris
has the power.

00:27:56.441 --> 00:27:58.603
Please come with us.

00:28:00.279 --> 00:28:04.614
| don’t have the confidence...
But | can’t get back, either...

00:28:06.518 --> 00:28:11.354
| have no excuse for bringing you
here without permission, but...

00:28:14.893 --> 00:28:17.419
This sword is pretty sharp.
Use it.

00:28:18.230 --> 00:28:20.392
Thank you for thinking of me.

00:28:21.400 --> 00:28:23.732
Aishe and Tance also hoped
you would come with us.
